          </button>

          <div class="pva-accordion__panel" id="pva-accordion-panel-26" hidden>
                          <p>Located in the heart of Preston, Preston North End Football Club is easily accessible by road, rail and public transport, making it a convenient venue for guests travelling from across the North West and beyond.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>By Train: </strong>Preston Railway Station is approximately two miles from the stadium and provides excellent rail connections to destinations across the UK. Taxis are readily available from the station for onward travel to the venue.<br><strong>By Bus: </strong>Regular bus services operate between Preston city centre and the stadium, with routes 19 and 19A stopping directly outside Deepdale. The journey from Preston Bus Station takes approximately 10 minutes.<br><strong>By Car: </strong>The venue is conveniently located close to Junction 31 of the M6. Visitors can follow the A59 and A5085 routes, with clear signage directing traffic towards Deepdale.<br><strong>By Air: </strong>Manchester Airport is the nearest major international airport, offering convenient rail and road connections to Preston.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Parking &amp; Travel Information</strong></p><p>With excellent road, rail and public transport links, Preston North End Football Club is easy to reach whether travelling locally or from further afield. Guests are encouraged to plan their journey in advance, particularly during matchdays and major events.</p><p>For further travel guidance or local accommodation recommendations, please contact our team.</p>
                      </div>
        </article>
          </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>
                                    


  <section class="left-text-image left-text-image--venue" id="venue-food" data-venue-section data-node-id="22:9088">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="left-text-image__layout">
        <div class="left-text-image__content">
          <h2 class="left-text-image__title">Food Moments</h2>
                                                            <div class="left-text-image__desc"><p>At Deepdale, we believe in making every moment count for our guests and team members. Whether creating dishes for weddings, annual dinners, award nights, conferences, or once-in-a-lifetime events, our love of honest, well-sourced, and expertly crafted food and drink - along with the exceptional moments and lasting memories it creates - is at the heart of what we do.</p><p>We cater for a range of dietary requirements, with allergen information and gluten-free options available to help guests make informed choices. Please speak to our team for the most up-to-date allergen and dietary information.</p></div>
                      
                      <form class="left-text-image__form" method="post" action="/food-brochure/download">
                              <input type="text" name="food_hp" value="" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="visually-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="venue_nid" value="35">
                            <div class="left-text-image__field">
                <span class="left-text-image__field-label">
                  <span class="left-text-image__field-label-text left-text-image__field-label-text--desktop">Download This Venue&#039;s Food Moments</span>
                  <span class="left-text-image__field-label-text left-text-image__field-label-text--mobile">Download Brochure</span>
                </span>
                <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" aria-label="Email address" required>
              </div>
              <button type="submit">Download</button>
                                        </form>
                                                      <p class="left-text-image__privacy">Your personal data will be processed by us in accordance with our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="left-text-image__privacy-link">privacy policy</a>.</p>
                              </div>

        <div class="left-text-image__media">
                      <img src="/sites/default/files/styles/occasion_card/public/venues/food/ACC%20Food%20Moments%20Food%20%28319%29_4.jpg.webp?itok=dUQ-atLK" alt="Left text image section image" loading="lazy">
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
                                                                        
