  <section class="venue-accreditations" id="venue-accreditations" data-venue-section data-node-id="48:5499">
    <div class="venue-accreditations__inner">
      <header class="venue-accreditations__intro">
        <h2 class="venue-accreditations__title">Our accreditations</h2>
                  <p class="venue-accreditations__body">We are proud to hold industry-leading accreditations and have been consistently recognised for our commitment to event delivery, hospitality and team development.</p>
              </header>

      <div class="venue-accreditations__grid">
                  <article class="venue-accreditations__card">
                          <div class="venue-accreditations__logo-wrap">
                <img class="venue-accreditations__logo" src="/sites/default/files/accreditation-logos/beam.png" alt="Beam" loading="lazy">
              </div>
                        <div class="venue-accreditations__card-content">
              <h3 class="venue-accreditations__card-title">Beam</h3>
              <p class="venue-accreditations__card-body">Beam is the UK's leading association for the business events, accommodation and meetings sector. As proud members, we align with Beam's commitment to best practice, quality assurance, and industry advocacy. Being part of this network connects us with sector-leading professionals, supports continuous development and helps ensure our clients benefit from trusted, compliant and forward-thinking event delivery.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
                  <article class="venue-accreditations__card">
                          <div class="venue-accreditations__logo-wrap">
                <img class="venue-accreditations__logo" src="/sites/default/files/accreditation-logos/mia.png" alt="MIA" loading="lazy">
              </div>
                        <div class="venue-accreditations__card-content">
              <h3 class="venue-accreditations__card-title">MIA</h3>
              <p class="venue-accreditations__card-body">MIA is the UK's foremost trade body for meetings and events, setting nationally recognised standards through its AIM Secure accreditation. Membership demonstrates our dedication to safety, service excellence and sustainability. Through MIA's training, research and industry representation, we stay at the forefront of best practice giving our clients confidence that their events are delivered to the highest professional standards.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
                  <article class="venue-accreditations__card">
                          <div class="venue-accreditations__logo-wrap">
                <img class="venue-accreditations__logo" src="/sites/default/files/accreditation-logos/green-meetings.png" alt="Green Meetings" loading="lazy">
              </div>
                        <div class="venue-accreditations__card-content">
              <h3 class="venue-accreditations__card-title">Green Meetings</h3>
              <p class="venue-accreditations__card-body">Green Meetings is the UK's benchmark sustainability standard for the meetings and events industry. As part of our commitment to responsible event delivery, we follow Green Meetings principles to minimise environmental impact and champion sustainable practices across our venues. This framework supports us in reducing waste, improving energy efficiency and helping clients create events that are both impactful and environmentally conscious.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
                  <article class="venue-accreditations__card">
                          <div class="venue-accreditations__logo-wrap">
                <img class="venue-accreditations__logo" src="/sites/default/files/accreditation-logos/stadium-experience.png" alt="Stadium Experience" loading="lazy">
              </div>
                        <div class="venue-accreditations__card-content">
              <h3 class="venue-accreditations__card-title">Stadium Experience</h3>
              <p class="venue-accreditations__card-body">Stadium Experience is a national collaboration of UK sports venues championing excellence in conference and events delivery. As members, we work alongside leading stadiums to share best practice, elevate industry standards and celebrate innovation through initiatives such as the annual Stadium Events &amp; Hospitality Awards. Our involvement reinforces our commitment to delivering exceptional event experiences, high-quality service, and standout hospitality within world-class sporting environments.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
              </div>
    </div>
  </section>
                                    <section class="venue-contact-cards" id="venue-contact" data-venue-section data-node-id="22:9021">
